      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-12-07T15:40:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Andy is totally right! Here are tentative status updates for the things he posted:</p><p>1) Wrath of the Cosmos character bios.</p><p>When WotC releases on the video game.</p><p>2) The Tactics videos from GenCon.</p><p>Hopefully in a week or two.</p><p>3) The Tactics scenarios for the minions maps.</p><p>These are in playtesting, so hopefully a month or so!</p><p>4) A new set of Achievements for Sentinels.</p><p>This is tied to the video game as well; should be just a few months.</p><p>5) Christopher and Adam haven't done their podcast.</p><p>Good question. Eventually?</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:30:01.921Z",
